# Questly — Complete Android App Build Prompt

# PROJECT: QUESTLY — A GAMIFIED PRODUCTIVITY AND PERSONAL GROWTH PLATFORM

Build a polished, functional, production-oriented native Android application named **Questly**.

Tagline: **Turn your goals into quests. Build your streak. Level up your life.**

Questly is a gamified productivity platform inspired by Duolingo's engagement loops, Strava's progress tracking, RPG progression systems, and the polished UX of modern indie games.

The app transforms daily productivity into a rewarding progression experience. Users create tasks called quests, track real focused work sessions, develop consistent habits, earn experience points, unlock achievements, evolve their personal interface, improve their skill tree, and play integrated mini-games during breaks.

This must be a genuine Android application, not a website displayed inside a WebView and not merely a collection of static UI mockups.

Use native Android technologies, appropriate persistence, functional navigation, reusable components, real state management, and robust business logic.

Build the application incrementally, but ensure the core features are connected and functional.

